# Art, Animation, and VFX

Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: M2 Vertical slice
Dependencies: `03_PLAYER_CAMERA_INPUT.todo`, `05_ELEMENT_REACTIONS.todo`, `11_ARENA_LEVEL_DESIGN.todo`

## Purpose

Establish an original readable low-poly visual identity for the vertical slice.

## Tasks

- [ ] Create original visual reference board.
- [ ] Define color, pattern, silhouette, and material language.
- [ ] Create one shared player rig or approved placeholder.
- [ ] Create Ice and Fire variants.
- [ ] Create locomotion and spray animation set.
- [ ] Create modular arena kit.
- [ ] Create territory material and shader.
- [ ] Create spray VFX.
- [ ] Create Mist reaction VFX.
- [ ] Create status and pressure VFX.
- [ ] Validate readability at gameplay camera distance.
- [ ] Validate asset budgets and import settings.
- [ ] Record all third-party licenses.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Visual identity is original and not a copy of another franchise.
- [ ] Teams and reaction states are readable without color alone.
- [ ] VFX does not obscure aim or territory.
- [ ] Character silhouette remains readable on every territory state.
- [ ] Assets satisfy documented import and performance budgets.

